  doc=Update creates a new version of an existing memory by replacing its Data\nwith newData. SlotPatch typed-patch compilation (D8 → RFC 6902) lands in\nPhase 3; for now Update takes whole-Data replacement, which is\nsemantically a "patch every field" operation.\n\nReturns the new URI matrix://cortex/<type>/<id>#<n+1>.
EDGES
  ^contains=matrix/cortex.Cortex
  ^defines=matrix/cortex/cortex.go

NODE id=matrix/cortex.Cortex.UpdateHead kind=method
