  sig=func (c *Cortex) repairHourRollup(w Window) (*RollupRecord, error)
  doc=repairHourRollup rebuilds the hour rollup at w ONLY if missing — a closed\nhour window's journal facts are immutable, so an existing record is always\nauthoritative (mirrors cascadeHours' build-only-if-missing).
EDGES
