  doc=TickInterval is how often the worker re-checks the journal head as\na safety net against missed notifications. Defaults to 5 seconds.\nTests can override to a small value (e.g. 50 ms) so DrainEmbedder\ncompletes quickly even without explicit notifications.
EDGES
  ^contains=matrix/cortex.EmbedderOptions

