NODE id=matrix/cortex.rollupRecordHash kind=func
  digest=b3:74b830d0463d963cc88fc46f50eb200b0b6036f94e181487a3ecfb3d1d75cf75 file=cortex/rollup_enrich.go range=135:145 lang=go exported=false byte_range=5495:5996
  sig=func rollupRecordHash(rec *RollupRecord) ([32]byte, error)
  doc=rollupRecordHash re-encodes rec exactly as BuildRollup does (EncodeRollupRecord\n+ sha256) and returns the RecordHash. This is the SAME derivation the\ndeterministic lane pins into journal.RollupPayload.RecordHash, so the source\npin an enrichment carries is directly comparable to a freshly-rebuilt rollup.
EDGES
  ^defines=matrix/cortex/rollup_enrich.go

