NODE id=matrix/cortex.sessionProvenanceDstID kind=func
  digest=b3:0467534466b349185a96296d147a3888a25234a47e95e7e38ec19be131368d92 file=cortex/provenance.go range=53:66 lang=go exported=false byte_range=2383:3029
  sig=func sessionProvenanceDstID(conv string, seqLo, seqHi uint64) memory.ID
  doc=sessionProvenanceDstID mints the deterministic synthetic dst memory.ID for a\nprovenance edge over the (conv, seqLo, seqHi) slice. Distinct slices map to\ndistinct ids (so a re-consolidated memory accrues an edge per slice); the\nsame slice always maps to the same id (so AddEdge stays idempotent). The id\nis derived from a domain-separated hash and is guaranteed non-zero.
EDGES
  ^defines=matrix/cortex/provenance.go

